    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 17,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "I mislike the feel of these woods. Creatures that live in a unicorn's forest learn a little magic of their own in time, mainly concerned with disappearing."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 2,
        "line": 466,
        "text": "No. Unicorns are in the world again. No sorrow will live in me as long as that joy - save one, and I thank you for that part too. Farewell, good magician. I will try to go home."
      }
